      "name": "Stylesheet",
      "description": "Base styles, a custom property and a responsive layout",
      "open": "styles.css",
      "files": {
        "styles.css": ":root {\n  --accent: #2563eb;\n  font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;\n  color-scheme: light dark;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n}\n\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}\n\na {\n  color: var(--accent);\n}\n\n.page {\n  max-width: 60rem;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: 2rem;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 40rem) {\n  .page {\n    padding: 1rem;\n  }\n}\n"
